  "cover_text": "When people ask me what my favorite horror film is (including a thousand two-minute options) I hear you say, \"My favourite horror movie is Revenge of the Sith.\" Most people have heard stories about people buying movies based on rich world -- this worked for me, not really for Bitter End, which gave me the great motivation after allowing marketers they \"could\" never \"own\" my own passion.\n\nWell, this is where Revenge of the Sith comes in. It's an original screenplay by Saruman and Prebat Rashid, and how will they make it a movie? Hard to say. But",
